  sentences:
  - Who? Me?
  - Yes! My Princess with the biggest and whitest teeth of them all!
  - '*Whispers* It''s true He''s got big teeth.'
  - Big teeth? Hahaha, no way, I've got perfectly normal teeth. Certainly not teeth
    as big as a wolf's. That's for sure!
  - Your teeth are almost as mighty as mine my princess. And your eyes shine like
    mine do! We are made for each other!
  - '*Whispers* He''s got big eyes too.'
  - It's rude to stare, my daughter.
  - Shiny eyes? That's, that's because I watched the moon too long yesterday. I swear
    I'm not suspicious! I'm not a wolf.
  - '*Whispers* What''s his deal with wolves? He''s weird.'
  - '*Whispers* He''s a bit weird, but you can''t badmouth guests.'
  - '*Ears twitching* Hahaha! Nothing about wolves no, I didn''t hear anything.'
  - '!'
  - '!'
  - Your ears are also the biggest, furriest...
  - 'Fuzziest! I''ve got fuzzy ears, yes. '
  - Hum...
  - Wasn't there a tournament starting soon? We can talk about my ...ears, if you
    win it.
